  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Cut capsicum into bite-size chunks.\n• Roughly chop leek. Pick thyme leaves.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 15-20 minutes.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839594ef7d5496ac4a6f3f9/step-50f96500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add cannellini beans, savoury seasoning, thyme and half the garlic, then cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add passata, stock concentrate and the water, then simmer, stirring occasionally, until reduced, 5-6 minutes.\n• Remove from heat and stir through roasted veggies. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839594ef7d5496ac4a6f3f9/step-b62db710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While soup is cooking, slice bake-at-home ciabatta in half lengthways.\n• Place the plant-based butter and remaining garlic in a small microwave-safe bowl and microwave in 10 second bursts until softened.\n• Season with salt.\n• Brush garlic butter over the cut sides of ciabatta.\n• Place on a second lined oven tray and bake until golden, 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839594ef7d5496ac4a6f3f9/step-68c16d20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cannellini bean and roast veggie soup between bowls.\n• Serve with garlic ciabatta.\n• Tear over parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839594ef7d5496ac4a6f3f9/step-a02e6e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
